true}, "american_express": {"nsfw": true}}}, "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": true, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@muze_416/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3312314, "client_id": 199253, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce2c2283237ea169618b171ff36b2d62", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce2c2283237ea169618b171ff36b2d62, https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afa9de2185fdedbc82fbd7272aaeb505 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e64c5bb7780038c8f8832c0f45e427f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5628a9dacd9f081061b9132814b08143", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5628a9dacd9f081061b9132814b08143, https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d22e8327f81d495253bb41e670320a12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23dc6822/uploads/origins/8db0870f-e299-4ffc-95ef-ea6119fa0ef6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7003d6f2ab9d9bb4fdb7043a9c2e06e8 3x"}, "body": "Hello nice to meet you!\n\nI would like to request an illustration of a fox girl character.\n\nI have multiple fox girls!\n\nPlease choose 1 fox girl to illustrate. \n\nPersonality details of each fox girl:\n\nBlue: Cool blue fox and stoic girl. She tries too hard to make those around her happy.\n\nRed: Cold bitch girl that is slow to open her heart. But once she opens her heart, the fox girl will love you forever.\n\nGold: heroine girl with cheat abilities, she will love you unconditionally. \n\nGreen: Closed from the world by her family she lacks any meaningful experiences. A noble daughter that wants a best friend. Amateur novelist.\n\nBlack: Noble daughter of a commander. She relies only on herself. She will love someone only conditionally. \n\nWhite: a genius stoic mage girl that cares only about her own happiness. Due to growing up in a harsh environment, she has issues learning empathy.\n\nPink: chaotic shrine maiden that cares only about the happiness of others. She believes summoning many rainbows makes everyone happy, but causes too many rainstorms.\n\nSilver: hard working holy sister. Overworked girl with flawless qualities, but always dealing with unlucky situations. She will complain in her thoughts about insane situations.\n\nPurple: elegant princess with emotion reading abilities. The princess is lonely because everyone is scared of the princess and stays away. \n\nDark-blue: a royal maid and retainer, but somewhat professional maid? The maid covers up her mistakes and laziness with brilliant excuses. Often serves a ‘healthy’ hot tea with aromatherapy. (It’s just plain hot water and a candle)\n\nDark-red: common sense girl. retainer by day, serious assassin girl by night. Skeptical of everything the Dark-blue maid does, but is usually ignored. (Wait isn’t this hot water?)\n\nOrange: 2nd princess. Younger sister of the purple ribbon fox. Plays a Villainous character in order to stand out in the political world. \n\nBrown: a sweet looking cafe maid boss that runs a cafe shop, she can be very scary. Her family specializes in coffee bean cultivation that grant permanent stat boosts when used in coffee beverages. While a gold fox is a cheat skill character, a brown fox is a cheat item character. The brown ribbon fox’s strength stat is super high, she can grind coffee beans with one hand or use them as projectiles.\n\nAll the details of the illustration are left to you. Anything is fine. \n\nThank you very much for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muze_416/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3312314, "client_id": 759416, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0285d8e38fe9d338205b2096d2af8db8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0285d8e38fe9d338205b2096d2af8db8, https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c9dca191e454139bc59140cd3ac9203 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f99065863dfec71059ac33ef8bc79ea9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e355d0e269296ea0a1b5b5963238cee6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e355d0e269296ea0a1b5b5963238cee6, https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f0b8a88d149a274fdcd456386c19f24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac46a99c/uploads/origins/85b00ed3-8731-4445-9f2c-53ee9819d89a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4fd5ab5975fe93d8e0656dcc1e357cf9 3x"}, "body": "始めまして！\nTwitterの方で、お勧めで流れてきた作者様のイラストを拝見して、描かれている画風がとても自分好みでしたので、今回イラストのご依頼をさせて頂きたいと思いました！\n\n使用用途は、個人的にアイコンや、PC.スマホ等の壁紙として使っていきたいです！\n\nキャラクター\n【オリジナル３Ｄモデル】Blanca;Redo | アトリエ・クルル #booth_pm https://atelier-krull.booth.pm/items/3290555\n製作者様のキャラクターのガイドライン確認し、二次創作への使用が可能なのを確認済みです。\n\nキャラクターの参考資料を載せています！\n具体的なポーズや表情、背景等は作者様にお任せしたいのですが、もうすぐ冬なので、季節に因んだ物を、イラストに取り入れてもらえると嬉しいです！\n\nご検討の方、宜しくお願い致します🙇\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qmLWfljvCAYlkHelscAn8gtZKQsgQx1h", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muze_416/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3312314, "client_id": 3745323, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f44331ea7622a6901323da3bb00db39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f44331ea7622a6901323da3bb00db39, https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf70fe99f2355cf0f1e8cb05b5b64f1b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69494188c8e54b54ae98d2befe742586 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=859aa2896ade38621a795b7e90958193", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=859aa2896ade38621a795b7e90958193, https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a3c9283ef92cde7263592de1da850bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05ba4d7a/uploads/origins/6c2cbdc3-bffd-4739-bae9-cd7f35841a9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=265e4519fccb8d354a4c15f7ac537714 3x"}, "body": "Muze-8様\n\n初めまして。\nSkebでイラストを拝見して、とても豊かな色彩に惹かれまして、この度個人依頼の受付の機会を開かれたとの事でリクエストさせて頂きました…！\n\n・依頼内容：TRPGでのOCの全身イラスト希望\n女性の方をよく描かれていらっしゃるところ恐縮ですが、Skebの男性イラストがとても魅力的にでしたのでリクエストさせて頂きました。\n\n・キャラクター：鏑木　葵\n\n・外見等：男性ですが少し中性的\n身長180cm程\n髪の毛は襟足の長いショートヘアーで分け目なし\n生気の無い白い肌\n全体的に細身で少し骨ばっている\n常に含みのある笑みを浮かべていて妖しげ\n（本人は愛想よくしているつもり）\nダークで艶のある雰囲気だと嬉しいです\n\n・イメージ色：血のような紅\n\n・瞳：暗い赤色\n少し伏し目がちの切れ長\n\n・服装：黒地に赤の差し色の着物（柄はお任せでお願いしたいです）\n唐傘を差しています。\n（資料内の鏑木着物イラスト参照）\n\n・使用用途：個人鑑賞\n個人鑑賞の為の印刷\nSNSでのアイコンまたはヘッダー\n依頼用資料内への掲載\n\n資料や不足な点がございましたらキャンセル、再送等頂ければと思います。\nもしご縁がございましたらよろしくお願い致します！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1knzmgFR3p7AQQiCKk8ou0DRaYsS1A8yE", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muze_416/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls